---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { ShieldAlert, Scale, UserCheck, CirclePlus, FunnelX } from "lucide-astro";
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service">
    <div class="bg-creamy-melt min-h-screen pt-40 pb-24">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-8">
            <header class="mb-16">
                <h1
                    class="text-5xl font-light text-brand-black tracking-tighter italic mb-4"
                >
                    Terms of <span class="font-semibold text-brand-primary"
                        >Service</span
                    >
                </h1>
                <p class="text-slate-500 font-light text-lg">
                    Last updated: May 12, 2026
                </p>
            </header>

            <div
                class="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-xl p-12 rounded-[3rem] shadow-2xl border border-white/40 prose prose-slate max-w-none"
            >
                <section class="mb-12">
                    <div
                        class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 text-brand-primary"
                    >
                        <Scale size={24} strokeWidth={1.5} />
                        <h2
                            class="text-xl font-black uppercase tracking-widest m-0"
                        >
                            1. Agreement to Terms
                        </h2>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-light">
                        Welcome to HSLUConnect. By accessing or using our
                        platform, you agree to be bound by these Terms of
                        Service. This platform is a student-led project
                        developed as part of the MAITPRO module at the Lucerne
                        University of Applied Sciences and Arts (HSLU).
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section class="mb-12">
                    <div
                        class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 text-brand-primary"
                    >
                        <CirclePlus size={24} strokeWidth={1.5} />
                        <h2
                            class="text-xl font-black uppercase tracking-widest m-0"
                        >
                            2. Scope of Service
                        </h2>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-light">
                        HSLUConnect acts exclusively as a digital directory and
                        networking facilitator for students of HSLU. We provide
                        the infrastructure for students to list, discover, and
                        RSVP to social and academic events. HSLUConnect does not
                        organize, host, or supervise the events listed on the
                        platform.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section class="mb-12">
                    <div
                        class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 text-brand-primary"
                    >
                        <UserCheck size={24} strokeWidth={1.5} />
                        <h2
                            class="text-xl font-black uppercase tracking-widest m-0"
                        >
                            3. Eligibility
                        </h2>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-light">
                        Access is strictly limited to current HSLU students. You
                        must use your verified <code
                            class="bg-brand-offwhite px-2 py-1 rounded"
                            >@stud.hslu.ch</code
                        > email. Any account found using non-student credentials will
                        be terminated immediately.
                    </p>
                </section>

                

                <section
                    class="mb-12 p-8 bg-brand-primary/5 rounded-3xl border border-brand-primary/20"
                >
                    <div
                        class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4 text-brand-primary"
                    >
                        <ShieldAlert size={24} strokeWidth={1.5} />
                        <h2
                            class="text-xl font-black uppercase tracking-widest m-0"
                        >
                            4. Liability Waiver
                        </h2>
                    </div>
                    <p
                        class="text-brand-black font-medium leading-relaxed italic"
                    >
                        HSLUConnect and its developers (Team A) and Lucerne
                        University of Applied Sciences (HSLU) hold ZERO
                        LIABILITY for any incidents, damages, or losses
                        occurring during events discovered on this platform.
                        Users organize and attend peer-led events entirely at
                        their own risk.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section class="mb-12 p-8 bg-brand-primary/5 rounded-3xl border border-brand-primary/20">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4 text-brand-primary">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-ticket"><path d="M2 9a3 3 0 0 1 0 6v2a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-2a3 3 0 0 1 0-6V7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2Z"/><path d="M13 5v2"/><path d="M13 17v2"/><path d="M13 11v2"/></svg>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-black uppercase tracking-widest m-0">5. Kiosk Settlement & Platform Commission</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="space-y-4 text-brand-black font-light text-sm leading-relaxed">
    <p>
      <strong>Physical Kiosk Protocol:</strong> For any events featuring an Entry Fee, transactions are strictly payable by current HSLU students only at the physical event check-in desks ("Kiosks") designated by the specific Event Organizers. No digital payment processing happens directly on the digital interface.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Platform Service Fee:</strong> HSLUConnect charges a standard <strong>5% platform service commission</strong> on the total gross entry fees gathered for transactional listings facilitated through our RSVPs. This commission is audited at the physical kiosk and collected from the Event Organizers post-event.
    </p>
    <p class="font-medium italic">
      <strong>Transactional Integrity:</strong> Organizers are responsible for verifying student credentials physically at the desk before marking tickets as paid. The HSLUConnect team holds no liability for cash discrepancies, handling issues, or organizer failure to coordinate physical logistics on campus.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

                 <section class="mb-12">
                    <div
                        class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 text-brand-primary"
                    >
                        <FunnelX size={24} strokeWidth={1.5} />
                        <h2
                            class="text-xl font-black uppercase tracking-widest m-0"
                        >
                            6. Content Moderation & Conduct
                        </h2>
                    </div>
                     <ul class="space-y-4 text-slate-600 font-light">
                        <li>
                            Users must follow the HSLU Student Code of Conduct.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Spamming, commercial solicitation, or fraudulent
                            events are strictly prohibited.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Official events are reserved for verified staff and
                            student representatives.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            The HSLUConnect team reserves the right to remove
                            any content or terminate any account that violates
                            these terms or is deemed inappropriate for the
                            student community.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </section>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
